1
00:00:00,404 --> 00:00:02,864
Can we please just stop saying "coitus"?

2
00:00:03,031 --> 00:00:05,661
(Sheldon:)Technically,
that would be coitus interruptus.

3
00:00:06,451 --> 00:00:09,491
(Penny:)Hey, is there a trick
to getting it to switch from tub to shower?

4
00:00:09,663 --> 00:00:11,453
(Penny:)Oh, hi, sorry.

5
00:00:11,623 --> 00:00:12,953
(Penny:)Hello.

6
00:00:14,293 --> 00:00:16,543
Enchanté, mademoiselle.

7
00:00:18,255 --> 00:00:21,345
(Howard:)Howard Wolowitz,
CalTech Department of Applied Physics.

8
00:00:21,508 --> 00:00:23,388
(Howard:)You may be familiar
with some of my work.

9
00:00:23,552 --> 00:00:26,012
(Howard:)It's currently orbiting
Jupiter's largest moon...

10
00:00:26,179 --> 00:00:29,019
(Howard:)...taking high-resolution
digital photographs.

11
00:00:29,808 --> 00:00:32,728
(Penny:)Penny. I work at
The Cheesecake Factory.

12
00:00:32,895 --> 00:00:34,935
(Leonard:)- I'll show you the trick with the shower.
- Okay.

13
00:00:35,105 --> 00:00:36,685
[SPEAKS IN FRENCH]

14
00:00:36,857 --> 00:00:38,317
(Penny:)I'm sorry?

15
00:00:38,483 --> 00:00:40,153
It's French for "good shower."

16
00:00:40,319 --> 00:00:43,069
(Howard:)It's a sentiment I can express
in six languages.

17
00:00:43,822 --> 00:00:46,452
(Leonard:)Save it for your blog, Howard.

18
00:00:47,242 --> 00:00:49,452
[SPEAKS IN FOREIGN LANGUAGE]

19
00:00:53,832 --> 00:00:56,082
LEONARD: All right, there it goes.
It sticks, I'm sorry.

20
00:00:56,251 --> 00:00:57,921
- Okay, thanks.
- You're welcome.

21
00:00:58,086 --> 00:01:00,126
Oh, you're just gonna step right...? Okay.

